// Title: Active Directory Domain Trust Created or Modified
// ATT&CK: T1484.002 | Tactic: DefenseImpairment, PrivilegeEscalation | Sigma id: 681ad72f-5173-4349-9d32-4695e938c122
// Data source: SecurityEvent 4706, 4716 (Windows Security Events connector)
// Severity: High
// False positives: Planned trust creation or changes during mergers and migrations
// Suggested analytics rule: run every 15m, look back 30m, alert when results > 0.
// Entity mapping: Host = Computer, Account = SubjectUserName
// The time filter below is for ad-hoc hunting; the analytics rule's lookback applies when scheduled.
SecurityEvent
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)
| where EventID in (4706, 4716)
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, EventID, Activity, SubjectUserName, SubjectDomainName, TargetUserName, TargetDomainName, MemberName
